---
import { page,asset } from '../utils/paths';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Exhibition Stands" active="exhibition-stands">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="hero-grid">

      <div class="hero-content">
        <span class="hero-eyebrow">Exhibition Stands</span>

        <h1>Make Your Brand <span>Unmissable</span></h1>

        <p>
          Professional exhibition stands designed to attract, engage and impress.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href={page('contact/')} class="hero-btn">
            Get a Quote
            <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <img
          src={asset('assets/images/6.exhibition/hero.png')}
          alt="Professional promotional banner stands"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="page-content">
    
    <section>
      <h2>Modular Exhibition Stands</h2>
    
      <p>
        Create an impressive and professional exhibition
        presence with our
        <strong>custom modular exhibition stand systems</strong>.
        Designed to combine the visual impact of a bespoke
        exhibition stand with the flexibility of a reusable
        structure, these scalable solutions are ideal for
        businesses looking to make a lasting impression
        at exhibitions, trade shows, and corporate events.
      </p>
    
      <p>
        Our modular exhibition systems can be tailored
        to suit a wide range of spaces and requirements,
        from compact promotional workstations to large,
        fully integrated exhibition environments with
        dedicated hospitality, meeting, and presentation
        areas. Whether you're exhibiting in a small
        space or planning a substantial branded
        installation, the modular approach allows
        your stand to adapt to your needs.
      </p>
    
      <h3>Custom Appearance, Modular Flexibility</h3>
    
      <p>
        Modular exhibition stands offer the sophisticated
        appearance of a custom-built exhibit while
        providing the practical advantages of a
        reusable system. Individual components can
        be rearranged, extended, or reconfigured to
        accommodate different exhibition layouts,
        stand dimensions, and promotional objectives.
      </p>
    
      <p>
        This adaptability makes modular exhibition
        systems a valuable long-term investment.
        Rather than commissioning an entirely new
        stand for each event, existing structures
        can be reused and updated with new graphics,
        accessories, or configurations to maintain
        a fresh and professional appearance.
      </p>
    
      <h3>Designed Around Your Brand</h3>
    
      <p>
        Every exhibition presents an opportunity to
        communicate your brand identity and engage
        with potential customers. Our modular systems
        provide the flexibility to create distinctive
        exhibition environments that reflect your
        business, showcase your products, and make
        effective use of the available floor space.
      </p>
    
      <p>
        A wide range of compatible display accessories,
        lighting solutions, and design accents can be
        incorporated to enhance both the appearance
        and functionality of your stand. From illuminated
        branding and product showcases to dedicated
        workstations and reception counters, each
        element can contribute to a coordinated and
        welcoming exhibition experience.
      </p>
    
      <h3>Display Features &amp; Options</h3>
    
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>Integrated workstations and meeting areas</li>
        <li>Reception and promotional counters</li>
        <li>Product showcases and display cabinets</li>
        <li>Branded display pods and presentation areas</li>
        <li>Hospitality and visitor engagement spaces</li>
        <li>Custom graphics and branded display panels</li>
        <li>Integrated lighting and display accessories</li>
        <li>Flexible layouts for different stand sizes and shapes</li>
        <li>Reusable structures with expandable configurations</li>
        <li>Additional options to suit individual exhibition requirements</li>
      </ul>
    
      <p>
        Whether you're planning a single exhibition
        or attending multiple events throughout the
        year, our modular exhibition stands provide
        a versatile, professional, and cost-effective
        solution that can evolve alongside your
        business.
      </p>
    </section>


    <section class="row text-center image-content">
      <div class="col-sm-6">
        <img src={asset('assets/images/6.exhibition/image1.jpg')} alt="Portable modular exhibition stand setup at a conference" />
      </div>
      <div class="col-sm-6">
        <img src={asset('assets/images/6.exhibition/image2.jpg')} alt="Brand event display stand with promotional materials" />
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
